{
  "type": "mod",
  "id": 2631,
  "hub_id": null,
  "guid": "com.quletpills.scm",
  "name": "Softcore Meds",
  "slug": "softcore-meds",
  "teaser": "Fast-Paced Healing: Restore Black Limbs With Stim, Restore All Black Limbs With Surgical In One Go",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/ocqANc0YvgPuEeQs1BCJmyCMhCW5quzJhO6SEqTV.png",
  "downloads": 3140,
  "favourites_count": 7,
  "description": "<h1>Features</h1>\n<h3>1. Restore Limbs with Stims</h3>\n<p>Now you can restore destory limb with stimulator,  just that simple.\nCurrent only apply to <strong>“eTG-change regenerative stimulant injector”</strong>.</p>\n<h4>Balance</h4>\n<p>Not without some <strong>debuff</strong> to balance gameplay, Include side effect:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<ul>\n<li>Hands Tremor  (60s)</li>\n<li>Tunnel Effect  (60s)</li>\n<li>Energy Drain (equals the amount of limb max health, reduced by the “Metabolism” skill)</li>\n<li>Hydration Drain (equals the amount of limb max health, reduced by the “Metabolism” skill)</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>2. Quick Access Limb Selector</h3>\n<p>Also works with limb selection via the quick access slot.</p>\n<h3>3. Multi-Limb Surgical Restoration</h3>\n<p>Restore multiple destroyed limbs with a single surgical action, consuming resources based on the number of limbs.\nCurrently applies to <strong>“Surv12”</strong> and <strong>“CMS”</strong>.</p>\n<hr />\n<h2>Demo GIF</h2>\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-2-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Restore Limbs with Stims</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://imgur.com/p0OADSZ\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GeSieXg.gif\" alt=\"demo-gif\" /></a></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-2-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Quick Access Limb Selector</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://imgur.com/pKTpNpl\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/26Sxi9U.gif\" alt=\"demo-gif\" /></a></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-2-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Surgical  QOL</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://imgur.com/xW6LNpc\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Mk75O51.gif\" alt=\"demo-gif\" /></a></p></div></div></div>\n<h2>Other</h2>\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">FIKA + Headless</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>It runs without errors or crashes, but player state syncing has not been tested,\nas I only have one PC. This plugin is 100% client-side and does not need to be installed on the Headless instance.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Compatibility</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li>Continous Healing (just disable “Heal Limbs” option in that mod )</li>\n<li>Healing AutoCancel</li>\n<li>Any other mod that add “New Container”, could not work with QOL feature, let me know when it happen</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">How to install</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Download the zip and copy (drag) the BepInEx folder in package, to your SPT main folder (where EscapeFromTarkov.exe locates)</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Uninstall</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Just remove the dll file in YourSPT/BepInEx/SoftCoreMeds/SoftCoreMeds.dll</p></div></div></div>\n<h1>Feedback</h1>\n<p>If you encounter any issues, please report them on GitHub Issues with log, it’s easier that way.</p>\n",
